    "message": "This package has been replaced by Dequeueable. The new package has been significantly redesigned: it now operates as an ephemeral job runner (single message per execution), removes the listener/background service pattern, drops batch processing, and simplifies the API. Please review the documentation before migrating as this is a breaking change.",
